and the Celebrity Sex Pass.

8
00:01:52,487 --> 00:01:53,738
Hey, Ollie.

9
00:01:53,822 --> 00:01:55,323
And that's
Gail right there.

10
00:01:55,406 --> 00:01:58,076
She's a shining light around
these parts.

11
00:01:58,159 --> 00:01:59,369
You know, I don't
like playing favorites

12
00:01:59,452 --> 00:02:00,620
with people in the town

13
00:02:00,703 --> 00:02:01,788
but fuck it,
I don't give a shit.

14
00:02:01,871 --> 00:02:03,039
Gail's my favorite.

15
00:02:03,123 --> 00:02:04,124
And in just
a couple of weeks,

16
00:02:04,207 --> 00:02:05,625
we're all gonna
be gathering

17
