-No. I'm good.

1786
01:10:07,953 --> 01:10:08,913
I got all mine out back there.

1787
01:10:08,996 --> 01:10:10,831
-Okay. Everybody chill?
-Yeah.

1788
01:10:10,915 --> 01:10:11,999
Yeah, I'm super chill.
Super chill.

1789
01:10:12,082 --> 01:10:13,500
-Ludovica.
-Yes?

1790
